OL,3,GNEWSATT 2027 Sidecar regulations       
OL,4,Aamended                                
OL,6,FNew rules for the Sidecar class at TT  
OL,7,F2027 have dropped requirements for the 
OL,8,Flikes of bodywork, fairings and        
OL,9,Faerodynamics, but teams are still      
OL,10,Frequired to switch to Sportbike engines
OL,11,Fand electronic control systems.        
OL,13,FThe rules, implemented following a     
OL,14,Freview of the future of sidecars at the
OL,15,Fraces, were revised after feedback from
OL,16,Fcompetitors and teams about the cost   
OL,17,Fand time available to make the         
OL,18,Fnecessary changes.                     
OL,20,FIn June, the class was suspended on    
OL,21,Fsafety grounds.                        
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
